From: enjihn <150061999+enjihn@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wsi: filter synthetic HDR formats by underlying support

Only advertise synthetic PQ/scRGB surface formats whose VkFormat the
underlying Vulkan surface actually reports, so clients cannot select a
format the driver will reject. Covers both surface-format entry points and
preserves application-owned VkSurfaceFormat2KHR output headers.

